 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 *
 * camera probe overlay for the E1M-AEN803 (Ensemble E8, M55-HE) RAM-run.
 * Identical retarget to sibling probe/fillrate's and to
 * examples/aen/aen-camera-firstlight's: ROM to ITCM (path-reference form
 * &itcm -- the phandle-array form makes FLASH_SIZE=0 and overflows the
 * link), no MCUboot code partition. The CSI-2 -> CPI graph and the sensor
 * node itself come from the two shields stacked at build time
 * (e1m_evk_rpi_csi + innomaker_cam_ov9281); nothing camera-specific lives
 * in this file.
 */

/ {
	chosen {
		zephyr,flash = &itcm;
		/delete-property/ zephyr,code-partition;
	};
};
